    Bump ruby-prism to 2.0.0 and rubydex to v0.4.2
    
    rubydex v0.4.2 accepts Prism 2 (Sam's note on #1194). Flip prism_api
    to Location::start/end, lossy Diagnostic::message bytes, and
    ErrorRecoveryNode. Add PrismLocation so existing start_offset/end_offset
    call sites compile against the renamed API.
    
